[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0555","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-54458","title":"Linux kernel SCSI UFS BSG 模块释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UFS 驱动的 bsg 子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，在移除 bsg 设备后未将 bsg_queue 指针置为 NULL，导致后续对该已释放内存的访问可能触发 UAF。本地攻击者需具备低权限访问系统，利用此漏洞可实现权限提升，获取完全的内存读写能力，导致机密性、完整性和可用性均遭破坏。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，Red Hat 评估为低危，但 NVD 评分为 7.8（高危）。各 Linux 发行版已通过安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-54458"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.10.237、5.15.181、6.1.129、6.6.79、6.12.16 或 6.13.4 及以上。Debian 11/12 用户安装 DLA-4178-1/DLA-4102-1 安全更新；SUSE 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:01951-1 等更新。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 用户升级固件至 V3.1.6 以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用受影响系统上的 UFS bsg 设备节点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1e95c798d8a7f70965f0f88d4657b682ff0ec75f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/22018622e1e9e371198dbd983af946a844d5924c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5e7b6e44468c3242c21c2a8656d009fb3eb50a73","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5f782d4741bf558def60df192b858b0efc6a5f0a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/88a01e9c9ad40c075756ba93b47984461d4ff15d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9193bdc170cc23fe98aca71d1a63c0bf6e1e853b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bb4783c670180b922267222408e1c48d22dfbb46","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-54458.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54458.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-54458.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-54458","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54458.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-54458.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-54458.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-54458-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-54458-scsi-ufs-bsg-set-bsg-queue-to-null--1771405619000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-jc5w-m29h-g88w/GHSA-jc5w-m29h-g88w.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0549","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52560","title":"Linux Kernel ntfs3 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 NTFS3 文件系统驱动中存在缺陷，当 mi_enum_attr() 函数在解析 NTFS 文件属性时检测到错误后，未能及时将 inode 标记为损坏状态，导致后续操作可能继续访问已损坏的 inode 结构，进而引发内核崩溃或系统挂起。本地低权限攻击者可通过挂载特制的恶意 NTFS 镜像文件触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 Linux 内核 NTFS3 驱动的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52560"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:27Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.13.4 或更高版本，或 cherry-pick 补丁提交 `d9c699f2c4dc174940ffe8600b20c267897da155`（主线）及 `2afd4d267e6dbaec8d3ccd4f5396cb84bc67aa2e`（稳定树）。如无法升级内核，可通过 `modprobe.blacklist=ntfs3` 内核参数禁用 ntfs3 驱动，改用稳定的 ntfs-3g 用户态驱动作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2afd4d267e6dbaec8d3ccd4f5396cb84bc67aa2e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d9c699f2c4dc174940ffe8600b20c267897da155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-52560.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9d329f3fb4a036761a8cef4769f6255813453ca4/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2024/CVE-2024-525xx/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/CVE/2024/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52560.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-52560"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0548","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52559","title":"Linux 内核 DRM/MSM/GEM 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux内核DRM MSM GEM子系统存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者通过向目标系统提交特制的GEM命令控制`submit->cmd[i].size`和`submit->cmd[i].offset`等32位整数参数，在这些参数累加时可能触发整数溢出或绕溢bug。由于内核缺乏对这些用户可控参数的有效边界检查，攻击者可利用该漏洞在本地获取高级权限，最终执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用Linux内核MSM GPU驱动的系统，攻击者需具备局部执行权限，漏洞利用难度中等，CVSS评估评分5.5，属于中危等级，已在内核安全更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52559"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:07:27Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至包含补丁 https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/patch/624696/ 的版本（该补丁已合入主线内核）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户请升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-132-generic 或更新版本；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 或更新版本（参考 USN-7703-1）。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时禁用 MSM DRM 驱动（黑名单 msm 模块）作为临时缓解措施，但会导致高通 Adreno GPU 功能不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b99b2c4621d13bd4374ef384e8f1fc188d0a5df","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f1845e46c41ed500789d53dc45b383b7745c96c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3a47f4b439beb98e955d501c609dfd12b7836d61","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e43a0f1327a1ee70754f8a0de6e0262cfa3e0b87","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52559.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52559.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-52559.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52559.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-52559","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-52559.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-86f7-x66f-vfwc/GHSA-86f7-x66f-vfwc.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-52559.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-52559","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-52559.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0548.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0669","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0669.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57999","title":"Linux kernel PowerPC pSeries IOMMU 内存越界访问导致系统崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 powerpc/pseries 子系统的 IOMMU 动态 DMA 窗口（DDW）实现中存在内存管理缺陷。Power Hypervisor 可能分配与 DDW 范围重叠的 MMIO 窗口，但内核代码未正确将这些 MMIO 页面标记为保留，导致 IOMMU 在该范围内映射 DMA 缓冲区，引发内存访问冲突。该漏洞源于两个编码问题：一是索引变量使用 int 类型而地址为 unsigned long，导致位图设置时出现负值；二是 DMA 偏移量已按页对齐处理，但 MMIO 地址（64 位）未进行页对齐转换。本地攻击者可通过触发特定硬件探测流程（如 be2net 网卡驱动加载）利用此漏洞，导致系统内核崩溃（OOPS），造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.4.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57999"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:24Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.13、6.13.2 或 6.14 及以上版本，包含提交 7043d58ecd13 的修复。对于无法立即升级的 PowerVM LPAR 环境，可在引导参数中添加 iommu=nobypass 禁用 IOMMU bypass 作为临时缓解措施，但会降低 DMA 性能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7043d58ecd1381674f5b2c894deb6986a1a4896b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8f70caad82e9c088ed93b4fea48d941ab6441886","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d8cc20a8cceb3b5e8ad2e11365e3100ba36a27e9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57999.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57999","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57999.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57999.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-57999.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57999.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57999.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-2qw8-jh79-6qc9/GHSA-2qw8-jh79-6qc9.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57999","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1994996b0b1043aeb0b2d4db6d06b7a742460e16/usn/7651-5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0669.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0668","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57997","title":"Linux kernel wcn36xx WiFi 驱动未初始化内存访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 wcn36xx WiFi 驱动中存在内存分配大小计算错误漏洞，由于在分配通道调查（channel survey）内存时使用了错误的大小计算方式，导致未初始化内存被使用。KASAN 工具已报告该问题。本地低权限攻击者可通过触发 WiFi 通道扫描操作，使内核访问未初始化的内存区域，导致系统崩溃或信息泄露，造成可用性影响。该漏洞影响使用 wcn36xx 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57997"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至安全版本：6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13、6.13.2 或更高版本（6.14+）。Debian 11 用户应更新至 DLA-4102-1 提供的内核包，Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户应更新至 USN-7653-1 提供的 linux-image-6.8.0-64-generic 版本。无法立即升级时，可卸载 wcn36xx 内核模块（modprobe -r wcn36xx）并黑名单加载以禁用该 WiFi 驱动作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/34cd2817708aec51ef1a6c007e0d6d5342a025d7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6200d947f050efdba4090dfefd8a01981363d954","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64c4dcaeac1dc1030e47883b04a617ca9a4f164e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae68efdff7a7a42ab251cac79d8713de6f0dbaa0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e95f9c408ff8311f75eeabc8acf34a66670d8815","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57997.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57997.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57997.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57997","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57997.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-57997/CVE-2024-57997.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57997.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57997-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57997.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-cq3j-mpfm-r8ww/GHSA-cq3j-mpfm-r8ww.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0667","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0667.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57996","title":"Linux Kernel SFQ 队列调度器数组越界访问拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络调度子系统中的 SFQ（随机公平队列）调度器存在数组索引越界漏洞。当 SFQ 队列限制被设置为 1 时，第二个数据包入队被丢弃后队列尾指针未正确清空，导致后续出队操作中对空槽位进行减计数引发整数下溢，进而触发数组越界访问，造成内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过低权限构造特定网络流量触发该漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.10 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57996"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:24Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.297+、5.10.239+、5.15.186+、6.1.129+、6.6.76+、6.12.13+ 或 6.13.2+。可通过各发行版包管理器安装更新（如 apt install linux-image 或 yum update kernel）后重启。对于使用 SFQ qdisc 的场景，避免将 limit 设为 1，建议 limit≥2。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518(F)-4 PN/DP MFP V3.1.5 用户应升级至 V3.1.6。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10685681bafce6febb39770f3387621bf5d67d0b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1b562b7f9231432da40d12e19786c1bd7df653a7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1e6d9d87626cf89eeffb4d943db12cb5b10bf961","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/35d0137305ae2f97260a9047f445bd4434bd6cc7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7d8947f2153ee9c5ab4cb17861a11cc45f30e8c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7fefc294204f10a3405f175f4ac2be16d63f135e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/833e9a1c27b82024db7ff5038a51651f48f05e5e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e12f6013d0a69660e8b99bfe381b9546ae667328","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00007.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57996.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57996.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57996","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57996.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57996.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57996.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-57996/CVE-2024-57996.ql","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57996-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/siemens/CVE-2024-57996_SSA-082556.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57996.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0667.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0666","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0666.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57994","title":"Linux Kernel ptr_ring 硬中断阻塞拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ptr_ring 环形缓冲区中存在不正确的锁操作漏洞，ptr_ring_resize_multiple() 函数在调整环形缓冲区大小时错误地屏蔽了硬中断（hard irq），而实际仅需屏蔽底半部（BH）。当通过 tun 驱动设备事件触发队列大小调整时，该操作会调用 __ptr_ring_swap_queue 进而触发 page_pool 路径中的 lockdep 检查，导致内核触发 WARNING 并可能造成拒绝服务。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞导致系统崩溃，影响 Linux 内核多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57994"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:24Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.11-rc4 及以上版本（含对应稳定版修复提交）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户运行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-generic` 安装 USN-7653-1 更新；SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1 内核更新包后重启系统。如无法立即升级，可在 tun 设备使用场景中避免动态调整队列大小作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3257dac521d0ac6653108c755141dce634bb8ff2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/572777a258c048e0d0fb3a0c47430eadcefe80c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a126061c80d5efb4baef4bcf346094139cd81df6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e74801b7628dc52b17471aec729bc675479ddc73","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57994.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57994","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57994.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57994.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-57994.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57994.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57994-ptr-ring-do-not-block-hard-interrup-1767883622000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57994.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-gf8p-7594-m58r/GHSA-gf8p-7594-m58r.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-57994"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0666.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0665","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0665.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57993","title":"Linux 内核 HID thrustmaster 驱动端点检查缺失导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 HID 子系统中的 thrustmaster 驱动程序存在端点类型检查缺失漏洞。在 thrustmaster_probe 函数中，未对 USB 传输端点类型进行正确校验，导致 USB 管道与传输端点之间存在类型不匹配，可触发内核警告。该漏洞由 syzbot 工具发现，攻击者需要本地低权限访问系统，通过插入特制的 Thrustmaster 游戏外设来触发此问题，造成内核警告信息泄露或拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已合入修复补丁，通过添加端点类型检查来消除该问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57993"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:24Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上版本，这些版本已包含针对 hid-thrustmaster 驱动 USB 端点类型检查的修复补丁。如无法立即升级内核，可应用以下补丁提交：220883fba325、ae730deded66、e5bcae4212a6、816e84602900 或 50420d7c79c3。临时缓解措施可卸载 thrustmaster 内核模块（modprobe -r hid-thrustmaster）并禁用对应 USB 设备，但会影响方向盘功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/220883fba32549a34f0734e4859d07f4dcd56992","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/50420d7c79c37a3efe4010ff9b1bb14bc61ebccf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/816e84602900f7f951458d743fa12769635ebfd5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae730deded66150204c494282969bfa98dc3ae67","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5bcae4212a6a4b4204f46a1b8bcba08909d2007","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57993.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57993.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57993.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57993","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57993.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57993-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57993.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57993.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57993.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-f4cr-gmw4-8qpw/GHSA-f4cr-gmw4-8qpw.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0665.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0664","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0664.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57984","title":"Linux 内核 DesignWare I3C 主控制器驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 i3c DesignWare 主机控制器驱动中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，源于 dw_i3c_common_probe 中绑定的工作队列 dw_i3c_hj_work 与模块卸载函数 dw_i3c_common_remove 之间的竞态条件。当驱动模块被卸载时，i3c_master_unregister 会释放 master->base 内存，但此前已触发的中断处理程序可能仍在执行 dw_i3c_hj_work 并访问已释放的内存，导致内核崩溃或潜在权限提升。本地攻击者需具备低权限访问条件，利用该漏洞可实现权限提升，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57984"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:22Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.76、6.12.13、6.13.2 或更高版本（含对应稳定分支的后续更新）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户执行 `apt update && apt install linux-image-6.8.0-64-generic=6.8.0-64.67~22.04.1` 并重启系统。其他发行版请更新至包含 commit `b75439c945b9` 的内核版本。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 I3C 控制器模块（`echo blacklist dw-i3c-master > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-i3c.conf && update-initramfs -u`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/60d2fb033a999bb644f8e8606ff4a1b82de36c6f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9b0063098fcde17cd2894f2c96459b23388507ca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b75439c945b94dd8a2b645355bdb56f948052601","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fc84dd3c909a372c0d130f5f84c404717c17eed8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57984.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/202